All 13 experiments are already recorded in `experiments/log.md`:

| Final Models | Checkpoint | Key Metrics |
|---|---|---|
| **Baseline best (exp012)** | `exp012/baseline_best.pt` | f0 RPA=97.14%, Amp Corr=**0.660**, MAE=16.48 cents |
